abstract: >-
  Local pre-release analysis code, frozen configuration, provenance records,
  checksums, and compact derived results supporting a multi-cohort secondary
  analysis of public pediatric blood and airway transcriptomes. No analyzed
  cohort included exposure to Bufei Fanggan Formula.
